# built on the release Mac with build-sidecar.sh in a new tree of the same build root (rustc 1.96.0,
# --locked), uploaded under this new name and verified by download. Like 9a32147e, the pin is the
# uploaded first build: stage that asset.
# Not uploaded yet: node-agent, comms-member-daemon, cluster-daemon.
